## 6. Calendar + Event Pages
- [ ] Event cards should be visible to the user.
- [ ] Google Calendar should be visible to the user.
- [ ] Date, time, location, and description are visible to the user.
- [ ] User is able to export/add calendar events to other compatible applications.
- [ ] User is able to RSVP and access links to their relevant pages.
- [ ] Functional option to add event to user's calendar.
- [ ] Navigation to other pages is available to user.
- [ ] RSVP is available given the time before the event, RSVP should be unavailable after the event/
- [ ] User registration status is visible and shown either "pending", "accepted", or "declined".
- [ ] Additional event information is visible only if the user's status is "accepted".
- [ ] User is able to share a link to the event.
- [ ] Emnpty State: If there are no upcoming events, then display message stating to check back soon for upcoming events and activities.

